      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1791533601759,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "你最在意什么？",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "Q",
      "originalText": "你最在意什么？",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "rnh2Z61qStQGUU_aRt_2U",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 70.00352478027344,
      "y": 84,
      "width": 406.3367004394531,
      "height": 60,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#2f9e44",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "aF",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 2010451379,
      "version": 3,
      "versionNonce": 2105735485,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1791533601759,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "在 X 上读、回帖子下的回复\n→ Zernio；或 SocialAPI.ai、Ayrshare（要自带 X key）\n先用真号测「被召唤」规则",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "A",
      "originalText": "在 X 上读、回帖子下的回复\n→ Zernio；或 SocialAPI.ai、Ayrshare（要自带 X key）\n先用真号测「被召唤」规则",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "p8ednUhfgJYUnfVV5oNjs",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 70.00447082519531,
      "y": 210,
      "width": 241.60043334960938,
      "height": 60,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#2f9e44",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "aG",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1341054803,
      "version": 3,
      "versionNonce": 1261569299,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1791533601759,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "网页收件箱 + 团队协作 + 老牌厂商\n→ Vista Social（贵）、Eclincher\nAgorapulse 的 MCP 只能存草稿",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "B",
      "originalText": "网页收件箱 + 团队协作 + 老牌厂商\n→ Vista Social（贵）、Eclincher\nAgorapulse 的 MCP 只能存草稿",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "h4l9maQgusWzkGaveVZWb",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 70.00773620605469,
      "y": 334,
      "width": 416.6407775878906,
      "height": 40,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#2f9e44",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "aH",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1411218675,
      "version": 3,
      "versionNonce": 1017825693,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1791533601759,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "号多，主要在 IG、Threads、YouTube、LinkedIn 公司页\nX 只发不回 → OmniSocials（按工作区计价）",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "C",
      "originalText": "号多，主要在 IG、Threads、YouTube、LinkedIn 公司页\nX 只发不回 → OmniSocials（按工作区计价）",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "FZ8UUAAFSmwIRdjMy-4of",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 70.00543212890625,
      "y": 436,
      "width": 274.8485107421875,
      "height": 40,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#2f9e44",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "aI",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1072129683,
      "version": 3,
      "versionNonce": 1333127859,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1791533601759,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "只发帖、不管回复\n→ SocialPilot、Buffer、Post for Me",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "D",
      "originalText": "只发帖、不管回复\n→ SocialPilot、Buffer、Post for Me",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "OrtEh0OG-t_l8RYsKP9kq",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 70.00411987304688,
      "y": 538,
      "width": 405.61676025390625,
      "height": 40,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#2f9e44",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
